<contentList>
	<content contentuid="he061ff22ge04bg414ag8811ged0bff92111f" version="1">星界之靴</content>
	<content contentuid="hb3b7062eg4812g4167g8ed5g026387137579" version="1">輕如月華，這雙吉斯洋基行軍靴仍記得星界的銀灰寂靜。皮革被擊中時會微微蜷縮，彷彿期待著人們一步跨出半個世界。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1011b3e6g5715g4692gb0c7g5884a38a4828" version="1">賦予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="LONG_JUMP"&gt;跳躍&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3ef3836fg639fg4728g967cgeb24bc10712e" version="1">班恩的暴君法衣</content>
	<content contentuid="h187c7fcagbd1eg4504gba86gcd742b47b4c1" version="1">蛛絲、金線，與恐懼的幽暗芬芳。這襲長袍本是為一位將成為暴君之神的男人所縫製，而這塊布料，至今仍向任何膽敢戴上他冠冕的人傾斜。</content>
	<content contentuid="h83976495g9643g4348g8ce7g9c6fce8c95a8" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_TERROR"&gt;恐懼靈光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩。</content>
	<content contentuid="h74ecc071g7740g4355g85ffg169cd790f693" version="1">吟遊詩人的天賦</content>
	<content contentuid="h2a854c49g24cbg4f6eg80aeg4b778882d7e2" version="1">“你們這幫可憐蟲根本搞不明白，這點戲法對我來說有多輕鬆，”學院舞會上最吵鬧的那位術士如是說——就在他消失進自己創造的袖珍維度的前一晚。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1638728cg2a02g4192gb1ceg0beae37c6933" version="1">覓血手套</content>
	<content contentuid="h68475357g28afg4de2ga9b5g8b0db7254a69" version="1">指尖釘滿了隕鐵的碎片，繚繞著一圈微弱的紫焰。這雙手套，為那些能從利刃穿刺時的阻滯中，掂量出一顆心臟之重的獵人們所造。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf46866b0g41ebg429fg8bf5g50ad5a3c2900" version="1">光速之靴</content>
	<content contentuid="h0c4a8cf6ge51ag4570gabafg6318140ef3c0" version="1">飾以羽織，底柔無骨，曾用於包抄敵軍與遠遠甩開友軍。鞋匠賭咒說這皮革是以風元素的吐息鞣製的，但他也賭咒說自己是個王子。</content>
	<content contentuid="h985b087ag44adg49aeg9868g8de546dc0d6e" version="1">至高防護披風</content>
	<content contentuid="h27a9746dg6fd0g4af9g9f99gc4910e8a6ebc" version="1">縫製於八人議會的工坊之中。法師奧提路克極偏愛這種織法，聲稱它能偏折任何瞄準肩部以下的法術，他堅稱，也包括裁縫遞來的賬單。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0473c299gb594g4038g961agae0cff63bd42" version="1">織法大師披風</content>
	<content contentuid="h34ad41bdg4578g41a6g9423g71afa9eedee7" version="1">法師坦瑟在密斯特拉本尊確認了他在八人議會中的席位那天，所披的正是這領披風。每一根絲線都記得他曾施展過的每一道法術，每當強大的魔法近在咫尺，便會隱隱泛起微光。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0cb4d312g2684g4ec8g8dedgb7478b40dff7" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FIRE_SHIELD_CHILL"&gt;火焰護盾：寒冷&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8ac3890cg1303g44e8gb668gff3f8766aa85" version="1">巴爾後裔繼承者之冠</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e3f09b6gf458g46aegadd7g0e91f6537ecd" version="1">這頂頭盔的雙角，曾親眼見證巴爾後裔之間最初的那場謀殺。薩雷沃克作為凡人最後看見的，是他手足遞出的匕首。而在巴爾的教派看來，至今仍無一樁行徑比那場安靜的家事更為神聖。</content>
	<content contentuid="h144f0d86ge0c3g4a05g808fg0552e38b1e98" version="1">令你體內充盈著&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ALCH_ELIXIR_BLOODLUST"&gt;嗜血靈藥&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h51578d16g9be3g464bgb31dgacc4d54ab4c5" version="1">熾焰堡壘</content>
	<content contentuid="hf8fa03afg4c2cg4559g8e17g2ee8e3eda1d9" version="1">以一位聖武士葬禮的柴堆餘燼鍛造，這副板甲在鉚釘中仍封存著一粒緩慢燃燒的餘燼。望之冰冷，身穿卻倍感溫暖，它對任何膽敢攻擊自己的事物都絕無寬宥。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd0e93931gbdd7g4884g9d8fg692a15c7b2f7" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FIRE_SHIELD_WARM"&gt;火焰護盾：溫暖&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2f3eefe5g4199g47a4g9b15g1a658a5edc76" version="1">精準護手</content>
	<content contentuid="h2fd1e392g5fffg408egba50g56fa93f61e36" version="1">平實的板甲手套，近乎樸素。不見輝光，亦無銘文，唯有每一位曾穿戴它們並贏下勝利計程車兵，所留下的那份冷靜篤定。</content>
	<content contentuid="h857c6487gd184g44d3g8f9ag4b98fb361f09" version="1">狡黠法師之帽</content>
	<content contentuid="haab25014g1c79g40cag80efg7074f9be8cc6" version="1">其形樂觀，其意叵測。帽簷向前斜探，彷彿正側耳竊聽。而在這寂靜的夜裡，曾有人聽見那毛氈喃喃自語，回答著那些無人問詢的問題。</content>
	<content contentuid="h29a003d5g2c39g45ccgb1a6g12056d117bba" version="1">賦予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FOXS_CUNNING"&gt;狐之狡黠&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DETECT_THOUGHTS"&gt;偵測思想&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0d9e3031g039ag4233gad08ge04d80a23faa" version="1">織法大師兜帽</content>
	<content contentuid="h22c3c145gdc0ag436aga4adg41ea697a85b2" version="1">坦瑟在受任聖職那天戴的正是這頂兜帽。儀式一結束，奧提路克和畢格比便對他搞了個著名的惡作劇。那惡作劇究竟是什麼，始終無人知曉，但那兩個搗蛋鬼此後整整一個月，打噴嚏時都會噴出漫天星圖。</content>
	<content contentuid="h83d10e92g7878g46c7g892agbe5cc0d49dd5" version="1">令你處於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLUR"&gt;朦朧術&lt;/LSTag&gt;狀態。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2099ac57gd798g4b35ga644g907b5e7980d1" version="1">宗師遺產</content>
	<content contentuid="h2d4ac6aegd3b1g4468ga6cbgea37574a45cf" version="1">曾屬色雷斯坎王室之物。這雙鐵手套仍記得那位王子的握持，並將他傳奇武藝的一縷餘暉，借予任何能戴上它的手。</content>
	<content contentuid="h13e229c0g63b7g4294gb8c0gd06ca335bad8" version="1">威儀板甲</content>
	<content contentuid="h3ec37184g92c6g4e7cg863ag82fafeb87afb" version="1">一件軍官配發的戰袍，覆蓋著這副儲存得完好無損的甲冑。顯然，這身板甲踏過的閱兵場遠多於戰場，然而它那凜然的分量，卻不曾因此減損分毫。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha4304c68g403ag40bfgbea5g4be8db311eed" version="1">賦予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PROTECTION_FROM_EVIL_AND_GOOD"&gt;防護善惡&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RIGHTEOUS_CLARITY"&gt;正義明晰&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h32d1c3aeg1f7fg4b67g9fbcg81be0f9c9df0" version="1">孔雀石兜帽</content>
	<content contentuid="hf1d55f8agd794g42bbg9109g1b779584a753" version="1">以碾碎的孔雀石染就的德魯伊絲綢。靜止時布面素淨無紋，冥想之際，兜帽上卻會浮現藤葉交織的細紋，待到風暴來襲，那些葉片便會紛紛飄動。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha4de2cefga144g4c3fgb4aag440ea915302b" version="1">聖衛勳章</content>
	<content contentuid="h0d396bdfg1ee4g460agb636g809fe9046d2d" version="1">提爾的聖物匣，為三神教團的至高審判官所鑄。金屬觸手微涼，當立於盟友身旁時，便會靜靜散發出一道守護的光芒。</content>
	<content contentuid="he45837aega2cdg4dc7ga751g590eefaf7c56" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_PROTECTION"&gt;守護靈光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7a03f96eg650dg4d5cgbb5cgad0097b63741" version="1">破誓者板甲</content>
	<content contentuid="h2b10ea9eg1feeg46f1g970ag48be022c764a" version="1">那些背棄了自身誓言、並將這份失落化為甲冑的聖武士們所披的戰甲。這身金屬，炎夏中觸手冰涼，嚴冬時卻又暖得反常。</content>
	<content contentuid="h647cad96g8be5g4203ga72fg03fa712562e0" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_HATE"&gt;憎恨靈光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3d4eb06dg950dg4508g8bceg597b5478b062" version="1">虔誠板甲</content>
	<content contentuid="h3d3c59f9g623cg4a48gaed0gcca2ab0de103" version="1">以虔誠之塔的白銀鍛造，那裡正是最初的聖武士之誓被立下的地方。形貌樸素，決意深沉。它的分量，便是一份恪守誓言的分量。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdafcbfa7g8150g4550gb9c3g587ee38b92aa" version="1">你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AURA_OF_DEVOTION"&gt;虔誠靈光&lt;/LSTag&gt;所籠罩，並獲得&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DIVINE_FAVOR"&gt;神恩&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h88d68802ge1bcg4088gb296g120025f1893d" version="1">和藹可親之戒</content>
	<content contentuid="h6270ce47g58f4g499cg8b99g8e26cc7b0f70" version="1">一縷寄於金屬中的小小善意。佩戴它的那隻手，打出的手勢會更為從容；而傾聽者們，總會在不知不覺間，比原先打算的稍微靠近一些。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0ea35400gafeag4b38g9bd0gd7fe110901f2" version="1">至高防護之戒</content>
	<content contentuid="h78515d3dgfdeeg455bga3c6gd2ab330d4dc5" version="1">細小的盾牌、小圓盾、手盾與臂鎧，淺淺地壓在戒環之上。一整個軍械庫的譜系，盡數佩戴於一指之間。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf02edda5g897dg4f4dgbaf1ge106c9f3abfa" version="1">織法大師長袍</content>
	<content contentuid="h7ddb7cf5g1e33g4277g9ce5g0af78438870c" version="1">曾由伊迪絲·克拉克爾所穿著。她六歲那年，便央求偉大的奧提路克收她為徒。他笑了，密斯特拉卻沒有，反而賜予了這女孩這襲長袍。伊迪絲比奧提路克多活了整整六十年。</content>
	<content contentuid="h44c981a1g0cbbg4634gb263g3e343f96d97b" version="1">賦予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAGE_ARMOR"&gt;法師護甲&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLADE_WARD"&gt;劍刃防護&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h71104e50ga2cag4649g82feg8ae2688fdf71" version="1">薩雷沃克的巴爾後裔甲冑</content>
	<content contentuid="h572b4822geeeag43ebg81b5gb7ec6f54b20a" version="1">為第一個妄圖封神的巴爾後裔所錘鑄。這副板甲至今仍在滴淌著那股野心，而幾乎所有史官都一致認為，薩雷沃克那張臉生來便適合扣在頭盔底下：下巴太翹，獠牙太多。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5911a4dag495bg46b4g9b6eg2b3a6b8299c6" version="1">以&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="END_ALLYABILITIES_BHAALBUFF"&gt;最血腥的傳承&lt;/LSTag&gt;標記你。</content>
	<content contentuid="h41bde74bg5b82g46e0g910dg80b859acfdf1" version="1">疾跑鞋</content>
	<content contentuid="h2551073ag7d08g4cb5g9c7ag2241ec09de69" version="1">柔韌的鞋底輕託著腳踝，精製的青銅彈簧縫嵌在鞋跟深處。曾是銀月城逐曉者之物，她們在每個夏日的黎明，沿著城牆與旭日競速。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd86b9c53gd668g45d6g9b0dgf9f4b84f0f85" version="1">自然睿智</content>
	<content contentuid="hc90e49b3ga5ccg409ega3a7g24d14a43017b" version="1">一頂以羽毛與橡葉編織的頭環，靠著主人的吐息，它才始終保持著這一抹鮮潤的綠。梟之守望者的德魯伊們宣稱，任何一頭能在耳邊聽見動靜的野獸都會對它開口說話，不過大多數野獸，其實並沒有什麼想說的。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e4db3e6g7388g4814gb132g87d874f6064e" version="1">賦予&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="OWLS_WISDOM"&gt;梟之睿智&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PETPAL"&gt;動物交談&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="he9753235gde0ag4f7bgbb7bgfed246d8d432" version="1">卓越重擊</content>
	<content contentuid="ha16be8aeg6d54g4709g9cffge2f1d449408f" version="1">攻擊時達成&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;所需的擲骰值降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;點。此效果可&lt;b&gt;疊加&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h94ffcc15g1661g4510g8ebbg7627d838b465" version="1">孔雀石低語</content>
	<content contentuid="h038110a3gd818g48d4gba4ag7f0cd6ef906a" version="1">感知&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;加值。你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SpellDifficultyClass"&gt;法術豁免難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;提高&lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="haa336baeg31f3g45aag9e26gacaf3aaab90d" version="1">誓冠之忠</content>
	<content contentuid="hbdd882b5g7f3fg45f4gb9eeg551f6ba126fa" version="1">你對&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;與&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;具有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;增加&lt;b&gt;+[3]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0cbe2ac2g1980g4bf9g8795g21a8992c357b" version="1">薩雷沃克的混沌之劍</content>
	<content contentuid="h2ac9ea4dge5fcg4393gac66gba603e0186e4" version="1">薩雷沃克在攀向神位途中所高舉的利刃。以謀殺縛於巴爾，它從每一道切開的傷口中痛飲深吮，並隨著每一個被遺忘的名字，變得愈發冰冷。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7653de21gc306g4cd8gaa37ga04a122b5e11" version="1">當你以此武器傷害一名生物時，恢復&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7216de07g0e0bg4fddgb23bg9f4c3e71cefb" version="1">星界步伐</content>
	<content contentuid="h0a777c9agb27eg4c01g86b4g165053289e9e" version="1">暴君靈光</content>
	<content contentuid="h7eae7a25g35b5g47b2gbf18g3e8f2dd450e9" version="1">餘燼防護</content>
	<content contentuid="h46aef5c4g7768g4774gb832g63e54939c30a" version="1">霜縛披風</content>
	<content contentuid="h0a631f43g31c2g4552g925cg2cc202855911" version="1">狡黠洞察</content>
	<content contentuid="h14025b62g2803g4a92ga3b6gcf1945b9e310" version="1">編織朦朧</content>
	<content contentuid="h31086832g815fg498cgbc7bgff48504ed823" version="1">元帥聖盾</content>
	<content contentuid="hed7e09c2gae96g45e3g83c6g19428d610a83" version="1">光環持有者</content>
	<content contentuid="h5dca90d6gd05eg45c1g8690g10691f13a385" version="1">憎恨靈光</content>
	<content contentuid="h8886639aga357g4343gb0d8g2129ded0e02a" version="1">初誓</content>
	<content contentuid="h50b66b95gfa58g4f25g9814g3a30be0e39bd" version="1">編織防護</content>
	<content contentuid="h60984863g3781g487aga7c9ga64c26ae259c" version="1">巴爾之印</content>
	<content contentuid="hbba691a2g5b62g4a6eg85cfg96b4144916c6" version="1">殺戮嗜血</content>
	<content contentuid="h8fc7636dgd836g4963g8fbbg22ffcc1c8e62" version="1">荒野之言</content>
	<content contentuid="h45bc72b6gcd3bg4f8eg924dgc4f37c0df813" version="1">巴爾之鋒</content>
	<content contentuid="h02ecd566g559fg46e7g8dacg40660387ad0a" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;觸發閾值降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h84765791g2a2dg4a81g9db0gbb3daf34f1be" version="1">精準打擊</content>
	<content contentuid="ha44e3e41gdef2g48edg8e87gccb9dc054e34" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MeleeWeaponAttack"&gt;近戰武器&lt;/LSTag&gt;攻擊獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;加值。若&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MeleeWeaponAttack"&gt;近戰武器&lt;/LSTag&gt;攻擊檢定結果不高於&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，則&lt;b&gt;重擲&lt;/b&gt;該骰子一次，並取&lt;b&gt;較高&lt;/b&gt;結果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6aa44c6cg161fg4db3ga145g7d2ba248406c" version="1">鋼鐵大師</content>
